msgid "cuda.tile.assume\\_divisible\\_by"
msgstr "cuda.tile.assume\\_divisible\\_by"

#: cuda.tile._stub.assume_divisible_by:1 of
msgid "Declares that ``x`` is divisible by ``divisor``."
msgstr "声明 ``x`` 可被 ``divisor`` 整除。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.assume_divisible_by:3 of
msgid ""
"The caller is responsible for the correctness of the claim; behavior is "
"undefined if ``x`` is not actually divisible by ``divisor`` at runtime."
msgstr "调用方须对所声明整除关系的正确性负责；若运行时 ``x`` 实际上不能被 ``divisor`` 整除，则行为未定义。"

